(text "ANIMA   /   UPPER-TORSO RPS CONTROLLER" (at 20.0000 27.0000 0) (effects (font (size 2.05 2.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "29e2c2ac-4c9f-5978-9d77-c14caf5d0652"))
(text "ANIMA Tabletop RPS Controller v1.2 | Low-Voltage DC | ESP32-S3 + 5 Servos + 3 Coils + 7 Hall Stops | Abhishek A S" (at 20.0000 32.0800 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "0e646a5d-251d-5d28-95e3-32999667777f"))
(text "01   MCU AND RESET" (at 20.0000 54.0000 0) (effects (font (size 2.05 2.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "4462926c-9099-5b40-b7ae-63f494f14d41"))
(text "Pi host UART 3.3 V only. Disconnect Pi UART when using the programming header." (at 20.0000 59.0800 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "0fc75d38-c04d-5ade-aecb-f4fe64b5310f"))
(text "UART0: cross TX/RX. EN and BOOT pull-ups on board." (at 23.0000 174.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "7ad1b1e7-4680-51c8-8034-b4bebdb8f36a"))
(text "IO19 senses the interlock. Native USB D-/D+ are unavailable." (at 23.0000 181.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "b33f6dc0-de87-5722-8304-dfaf4b5ebc8f"))
(text "02   LOGIC POWER" (at 244.0000 54.0000 0) (effects (font (size 2.05 2.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "98147d67-9892-55f4-9abf-f6a72e3bad19"))
(text "J1 receives regulated always-on 5 V DC. Pixel power uses its own external fused 5 V feed." (at 244.0000 59.0800 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "1e1126e7-f19d-5844-9554-5e10a25ca34f"))
(text "FB senses 3V3 after L1. Check regulator thermal and switching layout in review." (at 246.0000 162.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "c33e01b0-bddb-5cd2-b2b8-93215bdaf958"))
(text "The Pi has independent 27 W power. Reference grounds are common at the DC star." (at 246.0000 169.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "39f1c1d1-b043-546d-98f2-ba12705c4815"))
(text "03   HARDWARE ARM INHIBIT" (at 473.0000 54.0000 0) (effects (font (size 2.05 2.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "5e805d59-68d6-5e7f-ba2a-e6920991bb33"))
(text "A maintained external DC disconnect interrupts coil and servo motor power." (at 473.0000 59.0800 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "a8812c85-e91b-5ca5-86fb-39c63416e9d6"))
(text "Aux contact closes in healthy state. Missing contact or ARM_REQ low holds RUN_N high." (at 474.0000 130.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "dcf1d9da-7290-5f8c-9e8b-e1a16f7eafd0"))
(text "J5 carries logic only. The external DC disconnect interrupts motor power independently." (at 474.0000 137.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "30bb8486-a99c-590d-a27d-be6f7caa42bf"))
(text "Controller starts disarmed and must receive a deliberate reset after a stop." (at 474.0000 144.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "8f51275e-59ff-5595-8ec0-2792b2478f00"))
(text "04   SENSOR HARNESS" (at 20.0000 210.0000 0) (effects (font (size 2.05 2.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "b6d582b2-8fdc-5daa-9bdb-34e62ddf2e26"))
(text "Seven open-drain stops at 3.3 V. Thermistors are board-excited dividers." (at 20.0000 215.0800 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "180d1cba-cd1a-5e35-bf9a-db126f915c25"))
(text "Use 10 kOhm NTCs with known Beta. Treat open or short circuits as faults." (at 24.0000 350.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "03df7afd-fc1f-53e0-85bd-af1f1a8b2828"))
(text "Each DRV5033 gets local bypass at its remote sensor. Pair signal with ground throughout." (at 24.0000 357.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "79b775c5-7a20-5238-ba2f-72dd6036dea2"))
(text "05   VISITOR CONTROLS AND PRESENCE" (at 260.0000 210.0000 0) (effects (font (size 2.05 2.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "ec6a9775-38ae-59f9-b5bf-0e37e540b6f9"))
(text "All contact inputs are normally open to ground." (at 260.0000 215.0800 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "1c22d3b2-f10e-5b2b-b4f5-6845d8a48852"))
(text "Check the exact LD2410 variant and its 3.3 V UART levels at the harness." (at 265.0000 309.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "a7439964-50f4-5500-8021-5059cfb8a1e8"))
(text "06   FIVE SERVO SIGNALS" (at 474.0000 210.0000 0) (effects (font (size 2.05 2.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "0ea334da-1432-5ed9-a725-57350b53393f"))
(text "Signal headers carry PWM and return only. Motor power reaches servos through the separate fused 6 V loom." (at 474.0000 215.0800 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "7624763b-980c-56f2-9e66-993a41ce8db6"))
(text "OE is hardware-inhibited. TTL inputs and 5 V logic outputs suit the PWM loom." (at 475.0000 301.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "798b56a1-925c-55d0-8420-5e36a65fb3f5"))
(text "07   CHEST, EYES AND AUDIO" (at 20.0000 388.0000 0) (effects (font (size 2.05 2.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "c5ceaccd-3692-5077-8fee-63aca189fad0"))
(text "The external pixel supply must be current-limited to its verified panel draw." (at 20.0000 393.0800 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "2b6c308c-91f8-5512-81b8-5991da07d86b"))
(text "Bridge output: floating speaker pair, neither lead connects to ground. Keep the pair short." (at 26.0000 525.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "9aca5cff-cb0d-5bb5-b71a-f117d0b12973"))
(text "Send the same mono sample on both audio channels. GAIN is intentionally open." (at 26.0000 532.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "7efbf525-ac77-521a-9fae-b86e718f83a8"))
(text "08   FUSED 12 V COILS" (at 260.0000 388.0000 0) (effects (font (size 2.05 2.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "a486675e-ee45-52ee-9c6d-ab3842eda432"))
(text "Input is downstream of the external DC cutoff. Do not drive coils until an actual pulse/thermal profile is validated." (at 260.0000 393.0800 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid "c0acea0f-9e26-590d-ab4b-637cf599141d"))
(text "Channel 1 index + middle | Channel 2 ring + little | Channel 3 thumb" (at 264.0000 541.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "b9e74bb9-09d5-5a3a-8cfe-7870e7f40e2d"))
(text "Clamp diode is across each coil output. TVS catches drain overshoot. Confirm clamp energy and release on the bench." (at 264.0000 548.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "11ca6196-43da-55f5-a861-f6ac93d9d196"))
(text "Do not route servo motor current through this board. Confirm peak-rail current, copper thermal rise and cutoff behavior." (at 264.0000 555.0000 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "6508c093-32ef-5725-806f-e93ad8217205"))
